[gd_scene format=3]

; A y_sort_enabled node that HAS pixels of its own, with one merged child sorting
; behind it and one in front. Sort keys come from each node's position.y, while
; the drawn rects are chosen to overlap the bar — so the bar visibly covers the
; red block and is visibly covered by the blue one.
;
;   Behind  sortY 240 - 160 =  80  -> drawn first, bar covers it
;   OwnBody sortY          = 240
;   InFront sortY 240 + 130 = 370  -> drawn last, covers the bar

